 | PROMPT 5: public National Lottery result surface
 |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
 |
 | A SEPARATE PRODUCT LANE. These four routes serve national_lottery_* data and
 | nothing else: not GLO L6/N3, not an operator market, not a lottery provider
