 | ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. /search, /buy, /latest, /history, /year/{year},
 | /archive/{year}, /draw/{draw} and /result/{draw} are declared BEFORE /{draw}.
 | Reversed, the wildcard would capture a literal page segment and turn it into
 | a draw lookup.
